from pathlib import Path
root=Path('/workspace/zyx/docs/apps/docs/content/docs')
texts={
'zh':'''\n冷布局逆转换的原协调器准备见 `20261023-core-cost-cold-inverse-coordinator/`。私有入口只借用精确源 pin／文件／metadata 的候选 ReadContext，要求禁止 candidate 发布，并在原首次物理 I/O 之前无条件拒绝。正常公开路径保持冷模式 guard。逆转换使用原完整 ROW 投影，按 membership 的全局热集合判定字段来源；认证实际冷块、owner／字段计数、原 block generation／manifest、竞争普通 ROW 和 legacy selector。源字段页仍由既有完整所有权检查与 COW 保留／退役逻辑消费。没有热成员且完整投影恰为原冷整根时复用实际大值引用；有热字段需并入时规划新的完整 ROW 载体，不能把不完整冷载体当完整属性集。Node／Edge 命名空间、无属性存活 owner 和原 ID 分配语义不变。\n\n真实大冷值测试暴露并修复了 writer 内再次 openSnapshot 的锁冲突：ReadContext 的冷读取现在通过私有只读构造器把同一已拥有源 pin 附加到原 LargeValueStore／SlottedPagePool／SharedPagePoolAllocator，不再次获取快照，不执行重同步，也不授予独立发布权限。公开 store 构造和实际 manifest 认证保持原契约。保留原 40 项测试中两项死锁异常的失败证据；修复后 43 项定向检查全部通过，包括原有大冷根的字段修改、完整冷载体复用、冷热合并的新 ROW 载体、真实 Edge、无属性组，以及额度失败／已分配私有 ID 后取消／退款／重试。相关模块结果与源码身份见同一归档。文件大小、根、I/O epoch 和公开计数器不变。此阶段仍只是原协调器的零写入准备，不是实际公开转换／物理安装验收；owner 生命周期、完整空间准入、公开生命周期与最终 P7 仍未完成，进度 90%，无全量单测／性能矩阵／提交／推送。\n''',
'en':'''\nOriginal-coordinator cold inverse preparation is recorded in `20261023-core-cost-cold-inverse-coordinator/`. The private entry borrows only a candidate ReadContext with the exact source pin/file/metadata, requires candidate publication disabled, and unconditionally refuses before the original first physical I/O. The normal public path keeps its cold-mode guard. Inverse planning uses the original complete ROW projection and global hot membership tokens to identify field sources, authenticating actual cold blocks, owner/field counts, original block generations/manifests, competing ordinary ROWs and legacy selectors. Existing full field-page ownership checks and COW retention/retirement consume the source pages. Reuse an actual whole-root value only when the owner has no hot memberships and the complete projection equals that cold root; merging hot fields requires a new complete ROW carrier. Node/Edge namespaces, live propertyless owners and original ID semantics remain intact.\n\nTests with actual large cold roots exposed and fixed a nested openSnapshot lock conflict under the writer. ReadContext cold reads now attach the same already-owned source pin to the original LargeValueStore/SlottedPagePool/SharedPagePoolAllocator through private read constructors, without acquiring another snapshot, reconciling or granting independent publication authority. Public store constructors and actual manifest authentication retain their contracts. Preserve the original40-case report with two deadlock exceptions; after the fix all43 targeted checks pass, including mutation of an existing large cold root, complete-carrier reuse, a new combined hot/cold ROW carrier, actual Edges, propertyless groups, quota failure, cancellation after private ID allocation, refunds and retry. Related module receipts and source identity are archived alongside. File size, roots, I/O epoch and public counters stay unchanged. This remains zero-write original-coordinator preparation, not actual public conversion/physical installation acceptance. Owner lifecycle, whole-space admission, public lifecycle and final P7 remain open; progress90%, no full suite/timing matrix/commit/push.\n'''}
for lang,text in texts.items():
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-single-file-storage-plan.mdx'
 s=p.read_text(); assert '20261023-core-cost-cold-inverse-coordinator/' not in s;p.write_text(s+text)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/optimization.mdx';s=p.read_text()
