 new='同批大值、整列降级及逆转换准备与证据' if lang=='zh' else 'batch-local values, whole-column demotion and inverse preparation/evidence'
 assert old in s;s=s.replace(old,new);p.write_text(s)
 p=root/lang/'zyx/architecture/native-capability-acceptance-matrix.mdx';s=p.read_text()
 s+= ('\n冷逆转换与原有大冷值 writer 内读取：`20261023-core-cost-cold-inverse-coordinator/` 记录原协调器的零写入准备、源 pin 附加修复和失败／退款／重试检查。公开冷模式发布仍关闭，不能计为真实公开转换、owner 生命周期或 P7 通过；进度 90%。\n' if lang=='zh' else '\nCold inverse and existing large-cold reads under the writer: `20261023-core-cost-cold-inverse-coordinator/` records original-coordinator zero-write preparation, source-pin attachment repair and failure/refund/retry checks. Public cold publication remains closed; this does not accept actual public conversion, owner lifecycle or P7. Progress90%.\n')
